      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>İşte benim adamım! O olayı çözdü!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0000,0A00><U:000A>Aynı frekanstayız, dostum, değil mi? Evet!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
