      "text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Tamam, durun, bir tane daha geliyor!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0000,0A00><U:000A>Bu sizi bitirecek, yemin ederim<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,>",
